WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.601
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.601 --> 00:00:09.067
President Biden said on Friday
that he is "convinced"

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:10.868
that Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:10.868 --> 00:00:13.534
has already made the decision
to invade Ukraine.

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.901
Putin reportedly made
the decision somewhere around

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:17.501
his ninth birthday.

00:00:17.501 --> 00:00:19.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:20.801
He was a fun kid.

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:23.000
[ Laughter ]
President Biden held a meeting

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.300
of the National Security Council
yesterday

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.434
to discuss the situation
in Ukraine,

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:29.400
where they told him
it's basically like

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.834
washing down Taco Bell
with an iced coffee --

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:34.067
we know something's going
to happen.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.734
We just don't know when
and how bad.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.667
It was announced yesterday
that Britain's Queen Elizabeth

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.634
has tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:46.601
Wow. You couldn't wait
just a few more weeks

00:00:46.601 --> 00:00:47.701
to hit the club.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:50.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:52.734
The National Archives
confirmed last week

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:54.801
that former President Trump
improperly took

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.667
classified material
from the White House

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.167
to his Mar-A-Lago club.

00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:00.567
Also, all the copper wiring.

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:02.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.133
Ahead of President Biden's State
of the Union address next week,

00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:07.701
authorities in Washington, D.C.
will reportedly put

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:09.968
additional fencing
around the Capitol,

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:11.868
which is actually all you need
to know

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:13.400
about the state of the union.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:14.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.434
Rudy Giuliani is set to appear
in an upcoming episode

00:01:17.434 --> 00:01:20.100
of the singing competition show
"The Masked Singer."

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.667
I knew that couldn't be
his real face.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:26.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:28.567
Former President Trump
yesterday launched

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:31.234
his new social media app,
Truth Social.

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:32.934
It's expected to revolutionize

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:35.300
the way Americans
have their data stolen.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:38.901
According to a new survey,

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:42.133
22% of Americans said
that they are very interested

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.934
in being president of the
United States for one day.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.200
"When can you start?"

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.434
asked one man.

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:48.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:51.300
"'Cause I'd love if somebody
would jump in today."

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:53.534 --> 00:01:57.000
A dog in California was recently
reunited with its family

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.968
after it was missing
for 12 years.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:00.767
Or, in the dog's mind,

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:02.000
a couple hours.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:04.300
[ Laughter ]
"Everybody chill
the [bleep] out."

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:07.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:09.567
"I went outside."

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:11.000
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.701
AT&amp;T is set tomorrow

00:02:12.701 --> 00:02:15.167
to shut down
its 3G cellular network.

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:18.300
As opposed to their 4G network,
which shuts down whenever.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:22.267
And, finally,
an athlete from Finland

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.701
told reporters over the weekend
that, after competing

00:02:24.701 --> 00:02:27.300
in the men's 50-kilometer
cross-country ski race

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.667
at the Beijing Games,

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.968
his penis was
"a little bit frozen."

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:32.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.267 --> 00:02:35.334
Though, just because he needed
an excuse after he was caught

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:36.968
"warming it up."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.968 --> 00:02:38.133
♪♪

00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:40.767
Russian President Vladimir Putin
yesterday

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:44.534
ordered troops into separatist
regions of Eastern Ukraine

00:02:44.534 --> 00:02:46.567
and said they were
"peacekeepers."

00:02:46.567 --> 00:02:49.834
Specifically,
they're keeping this piece.

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:55.200
President Biden is set
to impose sanctions

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.434
after Putin ordered troops
into Ukraine.

00:02:57.434 --> 00:03:01.501
From now on, Russia doesn't
get the new Wordle until noon.

00:03:01.501 --> 00:03:03.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:05.000
It's very easy.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.601
Russian Wordle's very easy,

00:03:06.601 --> 00:03:08.567
'cause it's always "Putin."

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:16.767
Senate Judiciary
Chair Dick Durbin

00:03:16.767 --> 00:03:18.834
said yesterday
that his first call

00:03:18.834 --> 00:03:20.667
when Supreme Court
Justice Stephen Breyer

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:22.100
announced his retirement

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.067
was to his committee's
top Republican, Chuck Grassley.

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:27.534
And Grassley's first call
was to,

00:03:27.534 --> 00:03:30.367
I don't know,
Alexander Graham Bell?

00:03:30.367 --> 00:03:32.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.701
According to the latest numbers,

00:03:33.701 --> 00:03:36.834
more than half of unemployed
American men in their 30s

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:38.300
have criminal records.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.968
Also vinyl ones.

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:42.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:45.501
The social media platform
Snapchat

00:03:45.501 --> 00:03:47.100
unveiled a new feature last week

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.634
that allows users to share their
real-time location with friends.

00:03:50.634 --> 00:03:52.234
You can learn more about it

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:54.501
in an upcoming episode
of "Dateline."

00:03:54.501 --> 00:03:56.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.534 --> 00:04:00.767
"Snapchat wasn't the only thing
that disappeared that day."

00:04:00.767 --> 00:04:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.234 --> 00:04:05.467
A passable Keith Morrison.

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:06.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.667 --> 00:04:08.534
According to a new survey,

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:12.200
59% of Americans prefer
for toilet paper to be hung

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.033
so that the next sheet
comes from over the roll.

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:20.501
And somehow that 59% are all
married to the other 41%.

00:04:20.501 --> 00:04:22.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.901 --> 00:04:25.701
The New York Times published
an op-ed yesterday titled...

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:33.300
And I think I speak for everyone
when I say...

00:04:34.567 --> 00:04:36.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.901
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:04:39.901 --> 00:04:43.334
40% of Americans said that they
don't enjoy gossiping at all

00:04:43.334 --> 00:04:45.000
and then added,
"But you know who does?

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:48.400
Jessica, Jessica."

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.367
And that -- Oh, that's some
really good gossip.

00:04:52.367 --> 00:04:54.501
Look at them.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.501 --> 00:04:56.501
If somebody is whispering
in your ear,

00:04:56.501 --> 00:04:57.734
you can't make that face.

00:04:57.734 --> 00:04:58.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.934 --> 00:05:01.367
It's like, "I have a secret."
It's like...

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:02.868
Like, you can't do that
at a barbecue.

00:05:02.868 --> 00:05:04.901
And then everyone's like, "What
were you guys talking about?"

00:05:04.901 --> 00:05:06.934
"Um, the potato salad."

00:05:06.934 --> 00:05:08.334
♪♪

00:05:08.334 --> 00:05:10.968
President Biden has reportedly
met with

00:05:10.968 --> 00:05:13.601
at least three Supreme Court
candidates in the hopes

00:05:13.601 --> 00:05:16.834
that one of them will prove
worthy to join the elite group

00:05:16.834 --> 00:05:19.167
of the most respected legal
minds in the country

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:21.834
and Brett Kavanaugh.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.834 --> 00:05:24.501
President Biden spoke yesterday
from the East Room

00:05:24.501 --> 00:05:26.167
about the Ukraine crisis
and said,

00:05:26.167 --> 00:05:29.033
"As Russia contemplates
its next move,

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:31.501
we have our next move
prepared as well."

00:05:31.501 --> 00:05:34.400
Spoken like a man
on the fifth row of Wordle

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.567
with only two yellow squares.

00:05:36.567 --> 00:05:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.501 --> 00:05:43.000
I mean, Wordle is hot.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.133
Wordle is hot to the touch base.

00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:47.434
[ Imitates sizzling ]

00:05:47.434 --> 00:05:48.868
[ Laughter ]

00:05:48.868 --> 00:05:51.067
Russian lawmakers
voted yesterday

00:05:51.067 --> 00:05:52.734
to give President Vladimir Putin

00:05:52.734 --> 00:05:55.501
the formal approval to use
military force in Ukraine.

00:05:55.501 --> 00:05:57.567
Putin said, "The approval came

00:05:57.567 --> 00:06:01.234
with approximately
117% of the vote."

00:06:02.868 --> 00:06:05.834
Pretty good.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:08.000
Could've used Wordle
in that punch line.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.968
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.968 --> 00:06:14.601
Sorry. It's hard
to follow a Wordle joke.

00:06:14.601 --> 00:06:16.000
President Biden met yesterday

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.367
with the Ukrainian
foreign minister.

00:06:17.367 --> 00:06:18.567
The meeting wasn't planned.

00:06:18.567 --> 00:06:21.067
He just very quickly
decided to move here.

00:06:21.067 --> 00:06:22.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.834 --> 00:06:25.234
"Any good restaurants?"

00:06:25.234 --> 00:06:27.434
In a new episode
of a right-wing podcast,

00:06:27.434 --> 00:06:28.734
former President Trump said that

00:06:28.734 --> 00:06:30.267
Russian
President Vladimir Putin's

00:06:30.267 --> 00:06:33.667
invasion into Ukraine was,
"Genius and wonderful,"

00:06:33.667 --> 00:06:36.133
and I got to say,
it's a pretty brilliant way

00:06:36.133 --> 00:06:38.200
to make Putin
second-guess himself.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:42.300
"Who likes plan?
Oh, boy. This is not good.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.734
[ Laughter ]
Genius? Ay, ay, ay."

00:06:44.734 --> 00:06:47.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.467 --> 00:06:51.434
You -- We fact-checked that,
right?

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.968
We fact-checked that Putin, when
he's upset, says "ay, ay, ay"?

00:06:55.968 --> 00:06:57.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.334 --> 00:06:59.100
I don't want to be out here
looking like a -- Alright.

00:07:01.868 --> 00:07:03.567
According to a new report
published in

00:07:03.567 --> 00:07:04.767
The New York Times Magazine,

00:07:04.767 --> 00:07:06.334
an aide to former
President Trump

00:07:06.334 --> 00:07:08.467
described a 2019
White House meeting

00:07:08.467 --> 00:07:11.634
with Supreme Court Justice
Clarence Thomas' wife, Ginni,

00:07:11.634 --> 00:07:15.267
as being so crazy that Trump
"tried to reign it in."

00:07:15.267 --> 00:07:16.868
Whoa, you know things are bad

00:07:16.868 --> 00:07:20.400
when Trump is the one
trying to keep things on track.

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.334
That's like Bruce Willis
telling the director,

00:07:22.334 --> 00:07:24.734
"I feel like this movie
has some plot holes."

00:07:24.734 --> 00:07:26.467
[ Laughter ]

00:07:26.467 --> 00:07:28.267
During a lunch
in Kentucky yesterday,

00:07:28.267 --> 00:07:29.767
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:07:29.767 --> 00:07:31.367
said that President Biden is

00:07:31.367 --> 00:07:33.501
a "thoroughly decent
human being."

00:07:33.501 --> 00:07:35.767
Added McConnell,
"And if it wasn't for that,

00:07:35.767 --> 00:07:37.200
we'd probably get along great."

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:41.634
And finally, a Florida attorney
was recently arrested

00:07:41.634 --> 00:07:44.100
after she allegedly stripped
naked in a bar

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.167
when they refused to serve her
because she was too drunk.

00:07:47.167 --> 00:07:48.634
And she must be
an amazing lawyer,

00:07:48.634 --> 00:07:51.400
because she still talked them
into a scotch and soda.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.067
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:07:53.067 --> 00:07:56.467
In the wake of Russian President
Vladimir Putin's invasion

00:07:56.467 --> 00:07:59.467
of Ukraine, President Biden
today announced the full scope

00:07:59.467 --> 00:08:02.234
of sanctions against Russia,
including blocks

00:08:02.234 --> 00:08:05.234
on Russian banks that hold
$1 trillion in assets

00:08:05.234 --> 00:08:08.367
and their ability to do
business in dollars, Euros,

00:08:08.367 --> 00:08:10.033
pounds, and the yen.

00:08:10.033 --> 00:08:12.601
Which explains why Russia just
tried to buy a fighter jet

00:08:12.601 --> 00:08:14.267
with a picture of a bored ape.

00:08:14.267 --> 00:08:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:08:16.901 --> 00:08:20.400
[ Russian accent ]
Is good for one jet, no?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:21.934
[ Normal voice ] Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:24.634
declared war last night against
Ukraine, and this is nice,

00:08:24.634 --> 00:08:28.834
Trump offered to host
the after-party.

00:08:28.834 --> 00:08:30.601
That's right,
Vladimir Putin declared war

00:08:30.601 --> 00:08:32.734
last night against Ukraine
but said that Russia

00:08:32.734 --> 00:08:34.868
has no plans to, "occupy."

00:08:34.868 --> 00:08:38.367
Oh, buddy,
nobody has plans to occupy.

00:08:38.367 --> 00:08:40.634
We all remember when our war
in Iraq was supposed to

00:08:40.634 --> 00:08:42.133
be a three-day weekend.

00:08:42.133 --> 00:08:44.734
You're like that guy who thinks
he is going to have one drink

00:08:44.734 --> 00:08:47.667
with his old college friends --
No!

00:08:47.667 --> 00:08:50.200
You're going to wake up at dawn
in a karaoke booth

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.801
with your socks on your hands,
saying,

00:08:51.801 --> 00:08:54.801
"Oh, man, did I do
'Islands in the Stream'

00:08:54.801 --> 00:08:56.234
with sock puppets?"

00:08:56.234 --> 00:08:57.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.701 --> 00:09:00.434
After President Biden imposed
an initial round of sanctions

00:09:00.434 --> 00:09:02.901
against Russia, the Russian
Foreign Affairs Ministry warned,

00:09:02.901 --> 00:09:06.067
"There should be no doubt that
sanctions will receive

00:09:06.067 --> 00:09:08.601
a strong response." Come on.
You think you can attack us?

00:09:08.601 --> 00:09:13.667
This is America.
We attack ourselves.

00:09:13.667 --> 00:09:16.834
We good.

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:19.367
Following last night's Russian
invasion of Ukraine,

00:09:19.367 --> 00:09:22.501
the price of oil has jumped
to above $100 a barrel,

00:09:22.501 --> 00:09:25.100
for the first time since 2014.

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:27.367
And I'm the second person
to tell you that,

00:09:27.367 --> 00:09:29.400
if your friend has a Tesla.

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:32.234
[ Laughter ]

00:09:32.234 --> 00:09:34.734
According to new study,
the erectile dysfunction drug

00:09:34.734 --> 00:09:37.000
Viagra can be used as a new
treatment for dogs

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.601
with a rare eating disorder.

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:40.501
Though it's not going to help
with the embarrassment

00:09:40.501 --> 00:09:41.434
at the pharmacy.

00:09:41.434 --> 00:09:44.901
It's for my dog!

00:09:44.901 --> 00:09:47.667
An eating disorder.

00:09:47.667 --> 00:09:50.133
Well, it's rare. So you wouldn't
have heard of it.

00:09:54.334 --> 00:09:56.834
And finally actor
Leonardo DiCaprio announced

00:09:56.834 --> 00:09:58.934
this week that he has made
a significant investment

00:09:58.934 --> 00:10:00.968
in a 110-year-old
champagne house.

00:10:00.968 --> 00:10:02.300
Not his first choice.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.367
But it's hard to find
a 24-year-old champagne house.

00:10:05.367 --> 00:10:08.968
♪♪

00:10:08.968 --> 00:10:10.400
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

